# M / B014 — health-check, http-api, httpclient-factory/references/resilience.md.

C X20 EX RUN-016 | DEFAULT | Do not wrap normal EF Core operations in a generic application-level retry pipeline by default; prefer the provider's EF Core execution strategy for transient faults and handle transaction/retry interaction per the provider's guidance. | persistence resilience | Reported deviation with a concrete reason. | RUN-016 limits retries to safe repeats; no oracle policy forbids application-level retry of persistence operations or prescribes the EF Core execution strategy. | Wrapping repository calls in a Polly retry pipeline is a deviation that needs a reason and must be reported.

